<p>A normal paragraph with <strong>bold</strong>, <em>italic</em>, <em><strong>bold italic</strong></em>, <del>strikethrough</del>, and <code>inline code</code>.</p>
<p>Hard line break (two spaces at end of line).
This should appear on the next line.</p>
<h2>Links</h2>
<ul>
<li>Plain URL: <a href="https://micro.blog">https://micro.blog</a></li>
<li>Standard link: <a href="https://micro.blog">Micro.blog</a></li>
</ul>
<h2>Images</h2>
<p><img src="https://via.placeholder.com/640x360.png?text=Micro.blog+Theme+Test" alt="Placeholder"></p>
<h2>Blockquotes</h2>
